  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati kūngeniha Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūbīta myaka idatū a Baalamu na a Baisilaeli batūlwaga būlūgū bose bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa kadatū, ū Yehoshafati ntemi wa Yuda ūngeniha ū ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jīnījo ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbawīla a bataale ba mabità gakwe alīhaya, “Mumanile a hene ī gīkī ī Lamosi-gileadi yise, alīyo tūtaalī kwīta mhayo gose gose gwa kwīdima kūfuma ū kūlī ntemi wa Alamu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmūja ū Yehoshafati, “Ūdūgije kūja hamò nane tūkalwe būlūgū nayo ī Lamosi-gileadi?” Ū Yehoshafati ūnshokeja ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūhaya, “Ū nene nalī gīt'ūmo ūlī ū bebe, na a banhū bane balī banhū bako, nī falasa jane jilī jako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi bo bahangi ba ng'wa Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nang'hwe ū Yehoshafati ūshosha ūhaya, “Alīyo ni yabeelela kūmūja tame ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūbakobya a bahangi, biza ba kūshika gītī magana anè; ūbabūūja, “Mulībona kinehe, naje ī Lamosi-gileadi kwilwisha būlūgū nayo, nūūlū naleke?” Būng'wīla, “Jaga nguno ū SEEBA akūgūtūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi ū nzengo gwenūyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoshafati ūbūūja hangī, “A henaha atīho ng'hangibo ng'wa SEEBA ūyo tūdūgije kūbūūja mu nzīla yakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūnshokeja gīkī ū Yehoshafati, “Alīho ūmò wasaagaga, lina lyakwe Mikaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Imula; a hene ni yabeelela ū kūbūūja kūbītīla mulī we, alīyo natantogilwe ū nene ū ng'wenūyo, nguno ndūhū gete atanihangīlaga mihayo ya mhola; akanihangīlaga ya makoye dūhū gwa!” Ū Yehoshafati ūshosha, “Ītī chene baba ntemi, lekaga ū kūhaya gīko!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi ūng'witana ūmò wa batūmami bakwe; ūng'wīla, “Ū Mikaya ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Imula ng'wenhage aha ī haha yenīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batemi būbīlī wabo benabo, ū wa Isilaeli nū Yehoshafati ū wa Yuda, baalī baazwaalīla shizwalo shabo sha nyatemi, hūna bigasha ha masumbī gabo ga nyatemi, ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, hihī na mita gwa kwingīla mu nzengo gwa Samalia. Pye a bahangi baalī baabitinja bakūbahangīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa bahangi, lina lyakwe Zedekia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kenana, walī wabeeja na mapembe ga chūma; hūna ūyūhaya, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘A genaya ūkūgatūmamīla kūyūbasīsūla gīkī, a Baalamu kūshisha baseesagūke.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bahangi a bangī bahangaga mihayo ya mbika yenīyo dūhū; bahayaga, “Īdumīlage ī Lamosi-gileadi ūkūpyena dūhū, nguno ū SEEBA akwītūūla ū mu nkono gwa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo walī watūng'wa kūnjīla ū Mikaya ūng'wīla, “Bebe pye a bahangī biyo wideebelaga ū būhangi wabo; pye bang'hangīlaga būtindi ū ntemi. Na lūūlū lang'hanaga, nū bebe ūkafunye ū būhangi wako wideebile nū wabo; ūhaye mihayo misoga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, nakūng'wīla ū ntemi ūyo nalawīlwe na SEEBA dūhū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi bo ng'wa Mikaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūshika hoi, ū ntemi ūmūja, “Ūlībona kinehe Mikaya, tūje ū kū būlūgū tūkalwe nī Lamosi-gileadi, nūūlū hamo naleke?” Ūshosha alīhaya, “Jaga ūkīdumīle ī Lamosi-gileadi ūkūpyena dūhū, nguno ū SEEBA akwītūūla mu nkono gwa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Bebe Mikaya, nakūkwilahīja kūshisha nanalī gīkī yaya ū kūniwīla mhayo gose gose ūlū ītī kūniwīla ya ng'hana dūhū mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Naababonile a Baisilaeli basambaalile mu ngūlū, gītī ng'holo jitī na ndīīmi; ū SEEBA ūhaya, ‘A banhū benaba batī na ntongeeji ni bajage kaya dūhū; būlī ng'wene akalembeele mu mhola.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūhaya, “Wabona lūūlū, natakūwīlile gīkī ū ng'wenūyū atanihangīlaga mhayo gwawiza ū nene, ūlū ītī makoye dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mikaya ongeja kūhaya, “Na lūūlū gūdegelekage ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA: Namonile ū SEEBA igashije hī Isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi, na a mabità ga ng'wigūlū gīmīīlile gūmpīndya ū kū būlyo nū kū lūmoso lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūbūūja gīkī, ‘Nani ūyo adūgije kūnemba lemba ū Ahabu aje akīdumīle ī Lamosi-gileadi akachīle kwenūko?’ Ūmò ūhaya gīkī, na ūngī gīkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitūlwa gwiza moyo nebe, gūshika gwīmīīla ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA gūhaya, ‘Nakūja nene nakanemba lembe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbūūja, ‘Mu nzīla kī?’ Ū moyo gwenūyo gūhaya, ‘Nakūja nakabize moyo nomolomo ū mu milomo ya bahangi bakwe pye a bose.’ Ū SEEBA ūhaya, ‘Jaga ū bebe ūkagwīte ū nīmo gwenūyo, nguno ūkūdūla ū kūnemba lemba.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, managa gīkī ū SEEBA watūūlile moyo nomolomo ū mu milomo ya bahangi bako benaba pye a bose. Ū SEEBA wakūhelelile ū bebe mihayo mibi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zedekia ūng'wegeela ū Mikaya ūntūla ipī; hūna ūmūja, “Ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA aho wīnga ū kūlī nene, akabītīla nzīla kī hū wiza ū kūlī bebe kūlūngalūnga nang'ho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mikaya ūshosha, “Ūkūdeeba ū lūshikū lwene ūlīpeela kolobe kolobe kūja mu chūmba sha mu gatī kwibisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūlagīja, “Ng'wīnjagi ū Mikaya a henaha, munshoshe kūlī Amoni ū nsugi wa mu nzengo, na Yoashi ū ng'witūnja wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlagi gīkī, ‘Ū ntemi alīhaya: Ū ng'wenūyū ntūūlagi mu jeela, nīyo yaya ū kūng'winha shose shose ūlū ītī minzī na ngatī dūhū, kūshisha nashoke.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mikaya ūhaya, “Ūlū ūlashoke mhola, numho ū SEEBA atayombile kūbītīla mulī nene;” ongeja kūkomeleja alīhaya, “Igwaagi banhū bose!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūbūlagīlwa Lamosi-gileadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Isilaeli nū Yehoshafati ū ntemi wa Yuda būja ī Lamosi-gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ūng'wīla ū Yehoshafati, “Ū nene nakwingīla ū mu būlūgū nazwalile shizwalo sha kūnīīta natizūmanīka; ū bebe zwalilaga ī shizwalo shako sha nyatemi.” Ng'hana ū ntemi wa Isilaeli wijimīīlīcha, hūna wingīla ū mu būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū ntemi wa Alamu walī wabalagīja a bataale ba magogoteni gakwe ga būlūgū, a bose makūmi adatū na babīlī; ūbūwīla, “A bing'we yaya ū kūlwa na munhū ūngī ose ose, abize ntaale nūūlū ndo; ng'wisonjagi ntemi wa Isilaeli dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba magogoteni aho bamona ū Yehoshafati biwīla, “Ū ng'wenūyū atūduuma kūbiza hū ng'wene ū ntemi wa Isilaeli!” Na lūūlū būngalūkīla, alīyo aho bahaya kwandya kūntūla ū Yehoshafati, ūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba magogoteni būbona gīkī atī ng'wene ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, būleka ū kūnkūūbīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo munhū ūmò kwimanīla wadūta būta wakwe ūlasa isonga alolelile ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli; lyūdeebeleja ha būlūngīlo wa shizwalo shakwe sha chūma lyūnasa. Ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū ntongeeji w'igogoteni lyakwe, “līnyamuchage ī ligogoteni ūnīnje ū mu būlūgū naalabūka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlūgū būūlwa būlwiile kūshisha līīmi tole; ū ntemi walī igashije ng'wigogoteni wishindaalīja ūlolela ū kū Baalamu. Aho lyashika lya mhīndī ūcha; a mininga ayo gafumaga a higulagīje nose gitebeka ū ng'wigogoteni, gūyūhūūma na kūhūūma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla aho lyasalalīja ī līīmi gūzulung'hanya ng'wano, banhū balīwīlwa, “Jagi kaya, būlī munhū kū ng'wawe, būlī ng'wene kū sī ya ng'wawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbiza waacha ū ntemi, būntwala Samalia būūkanjīka kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ligogoteni būlyogeja h'ilambo ilebe ū mu Samalia ng'wenūm (na bamalahya bogelaga moi); jiza ho na mvwa jūgazabangīla a mininga gakwe, gīt'ūmo gwalī gwahayīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Ahabu, nī yose īyo wīta, nī numba īyo akazenga wītūūlīla būlenji wa mapembe ga mhūlī, nī mizengo īyo akīgītīlīja ndugu kūlwa kwīguzuhya; ī yose yenīyo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe. Ng'witūnja wakwe Ahazia wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Asa ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda mu ng'waka gwa kanè go ng'wa Ahabu ū ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati walī na myaka makūmi adatū n'ītanò aho alandya ū kūbiza ntemi; ū mu Yelusalemu ūsuga moi ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī n'ītanò. Ū nina ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Azuba; walī nshīke o ng'wa Shilihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mihayo ī yose, ū Yehoshafati washimīzīlaga mu nzīla ja ng'wa ise Asa; atagalūkile na kūjileka; īyo wītaga yalī yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA. Gwike a mapandī a ga higūlya galī gatīnjiwe, na a banhū baalī bataalī būja koi ū kūlamya, nū kūfunya ī shitambò, nū kūzuukīja būbbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū mu shikū jakwe ū Yehoshafati yalīho mhola a ha gatī yakwe nū ntemi wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoshafati; gītī ya būtindi wakwe, nī ya kalwīle kakwe ka būlūgū, yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bamalahya a bagosha abo baalī balekeelwa mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa ise Asa, ūbīnja ū mu sī būshila mo pye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ī sī ya Edomu yalī ītī na ntemi, ū nsugi wamo walī Ng'wambīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoshafati walī wabeeja meli ja būsūlūja ja kūyūja Ofili kūgūla zahabu, alīyo jitajile ī ng'endo, kūshisha nose jūkenaagūkīla kū ng'walo gwa Ezioni-geba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazia ng'witūnj o ng'wa Ahabu akanomba ū Yehoshafati ūng'wīla, “Bazunīlījage a banhū bane bayūja ū mu nyanza na a banhū bako.” Alīyo ū Yehoshafati ūlema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yehoshafati wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yeholamu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahazia ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi na mpungatī go ng'wa Yehoshafati ntemi wa Yuda, ū Ahazia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahabu ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli; wītema ī Isilaeli ikanza lya myaka ībīlī alī mu Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
